  <glossterm>Foreign Financial Institution (FFI)</glossterm>
  <glossdef>FFI is the abbreviation for Foreign Financial Institution. It refers to a non-US financial institution. The FATCA legislation contains an extensive definition of FFI and includes entities such as banks, custodian institutions, investment funds and certain types of insurance companies.</glossdef>
